# Lutri, the Spellchaser copies Bot1's Boros Charm, cast with "Permanents you control gain indestructible until end of turn",
# a mode with no target. The copy has the same mode (CR 707.10, 707.10c), and with no target there is nothing to choose anew
# (CR 115.7d): Bot1 is asked for no target as the copy is made (its other modes' targets are not offered, though Bot2 and
# Lutri would be legal for them). Both resolve and give Bot1's permanents indestructible; Bot2's are untouched.

